{"_id":"school0000000000000001","name":"Kuni Shugenja School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Combat Shadowlands creatures with jade magic.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Willpower</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Calligraphy (Cipher), Defense, Lore: Shadowlands 2, Lore: Theology, Spellcraft, any one Weapon Skill</p>\n<p><strong>Honor:</strong> 2.5</p>\n<p><strong>Outfit:</strong> Robes, Wakizashi, Knife, Scroll Satchel, Traveling Pack, 3 koku</p>\n<p><strong>Affinity/Deficiency:</strong> Earth / Air</p>\n<p><strong>Spells:</strong> Sense, Commune, Summon, 3 Earth, 2 Fire, and 1 Water</p>\n\n<p>[CR p.58-71]</p>","specialRules":"<h4>TECHNIQUE: GAZE INTO SHADOW</h4>\n<p>+1k0 to spell casting vs non-human creatures. Spells deal +1k1 damage vs Tainted targets. Free Raise on Jade keyword spells.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Crab/Shugenja","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000002","name":"Asahina Shugenja School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Defensive magic emphasizing protection and crafting.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Awareness</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Any one Artisan Skill, Calligraphy (Cipher), Etiquette, Lore: Theology, Meditation, Spellcraft, any one High Skill</p>\n<p><strong>Honor:</strong> 6.5</p>\n<p><strong>Outfit:</strong> Robes, Bo, Wakizashi, Scroll Satchel, Traveling Pack, 10 koku</p>\n<p><strong>Affinity/Deficiency:</strong> Air / Fire</p>\n<p><strong>Spells:</strong> Sense, Commune, Summon, 3 Air, 2 Water, and 1 Earth</p>\n\n<p>[CR p.54-73]</p>","specialRules":"<h4>TECHNIQUE: THE SOUL'S GRACE</h4>\n<p>Spend Void Point: reduce all damage rolls within 20' by 0k1 for School Rank rounds. Free Raise on Defense keyword spells.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Crane/Shugenja","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000003","name":"Tamori Shugenja School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Alchemical magic storing spells in potions.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Stamina</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Athletics, Calligraphy (Cipher), Defense, Divination, Lore: Theology, Medicine, and Spellcraft</p>\n<p><strong>Honor:</strong> 4.5</p>\n<p><strong>Outfit:</strong> Robes, Wakizashi, any 1 weapon, Scroll Satchel, Traveling Pack, 5 koku</p>\n<p><strong>Affinity/Deficiency:</strong> Earth / Air</p>\n<p><strong>Spells:</strong> Sense, Commune, Summon, 3 Earth, 2 Fire and 1 Water</p>\n\n<p>[CR p.54-73]</p>","specialRules":"<h4>TECHNIQUE: FLESH OF THE ELEMENTS</h4>\n<p>Store single-target spells in potions (takes Mastery hours to create). Potions activate as Simple Action (drink) or Complex Action (throw). Free Raise on Craft keyword spells.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Dragon/Shugenja","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000004","name":"Kitsu Shugenja School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Ancestral magic disrupting spiritual connections.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Perception</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Battle, Calligraphy (Cipher), Etiquette, Lore: History, Lore: Theology, Spellcraft, any one High or Bugei Skill</p>\n<p><strong>Honor:</strong> 6.5</p>\n<p><strong>Outfit:</strong> Robes, Wakizashi, Knife, Scroll Satchel, Traveling Pack, 5 koku</p>\n<p><strong>Affinity/Deficiency:</strong> Water / Fire</p>\n<p><strong>Spells:</strong> Sense, Commune, Summon, 3 Water, 2 Air, and 1 Earth</p>\n\n<p>[CR p.58-79]</p>","specialRules":"<h4>TECHNIQUE: EYES OF THE ANCESTORS</h4>\n<p>Spell Casting Roll vs Willpower x5 to detect Spiritual Advantages/Disadvantages. Spend Void to negate one Spiritual Advantage for School Rank minutes. Free Raise on Battle keyword spells.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Lion/Shugenja","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000005","name":"Moshi Shugenja School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Sun worshippers gaining Fire affinity during day.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Awareness</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Calligraphy (Cipher), Divination, Lore: Theology, Meditation, Spellcraft, any two High or Bugei Skills</p>\n<p><strong>Honor:</strong> 4.5</p>\n<p><strong>Outfit:</strong> Robes, Wakizashi, Knife, Scroll Satchel, Traveling Pack, 10 koku</p>\n<p><strong>Affinity/Deficiency:</strong> Air / Earth</p>\n<p><strong>Spells:</strong> Sense, Commune, Summon, 3 Air, and 3 Fire spells</p>\n\n<p>[CR p.56-70]</p>","specialRules":"<h4>TECHNIQUE: FAVOR OF THE SUN</h4>\n<p>Gain additional Fire affinity during day (lost at night). Free Raise on Thunder keyword spells.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Mantis/Shugenja","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000006","name":"Isawa Shugenja School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Premier spell-casters choosing any affinity.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Intelligence</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Calligraphy (Cipher), Lore: Theology, any one Lore Skill, Medicine, Meditation, Spellcraft, any one High Skill</p>\n<p><strong>Honor:</strong> 4.5</p>\n<p><strong>Outfit:</strong> Robes, Wakizashi, any 1 weapon, Scroll Satchel, Traveling Pack, 5 koku</p>\n<p><strong>Affinity/Deficiency:</strong> Any (player choice, including Void) / None</p>\n<p><strong>Spells:</strong> Sense, Commune, Summon, 3 spells of any one element, 2 spells of any other element, 1 spell of a third element, and 1 spell of a fourth element</p>\n\n<p>[CR p.54-73]</p>","specialRules":"<h4>TECHNIQUE: ISAWA'S GIFT</h4>\n<p>Free Raise on all spell casting rolls for spells of chosen Affinity element.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Phoenix/Shugenja","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000007","name":"Agasha Shugenja School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Multi-elemental magic casting with different rings.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Intelligence</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Calligraphy (Cipher), any one Craft Skill, Defense, Etiquette, Lore: Theology, Spellcraft, any one High or Bugei Skill</p>\n<p><strong>Honor:</strong> 4.5</p>\n<p><strong>Outfit:</strong> Robes, Wakizashi, any 1 weapon, Scroll Satchel, Traveling Pack, 5 koku</p>\n<p><strong>Affinity/Deficiency:</strong> Fire / Water</p>\n<p><strong>Spells:</strong> Sense, Commune, Summon, 3 Fire, 2 Earth, and 1 Air</p>\n\n<p>[CR p.108-127]</p>","specialRules":"<h4>TECHNIQUE: ELEMENTS OF ALL THINGS</h4>\n<p>Spend Void Point to cast spell using different Ring than normal. Uses spell slot of Ring actually used. Free Raise on Craft keyword spells.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Phoenix/Shugenja","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000008","name":"Soshi Shugenja School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Stealthy spell-casting with no visible signs.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Awareness</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Calligraphy (Cipher), Courtier, Etiquette, Lore: Theology, Spellcraft, Stealth, any one Skill</p>\n<p><strong>Honor:</strong> 2.5</p>\n<p><strong>Outfit:</strong> Robes, Wakizashi, Knife, Scroll Satchel, Traveling Pack, 5 koku</p>\n<p><strong>Affinity/Deficiency:</strong> Air / Earth</p>\n<p><strong>Spells:</strong> Sense, Commune, Summon, 3 Air, 2 Fire, and 1 Water</p>\n\n<p>[CR p.52-66]</p>","specialRules":"<h4>TECHNIQUE: THE KAMI'S WHISPER</h4>\n<p>Sacrifice additional spell slot (same Element) when casting non-damage spell to eliminate all visible signs. Free Raise on Illusion keyword spells.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Scorpion/Shugenja","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
{"_id":"school0000000000000009","name":"Iuchi Shugenja School","type":"school","img":"systems/l5r4-enhanced/assets/icons/school.webp","system":{"description":"<p>Speed-focused magic granting extra movement.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> +1 Perception</p>\n<p><strong>Skills:</strong> Battle, Calligraphy (Cipher), Horsemanship, Lore: Theology, Meditation, Spellcraft, any one High or Bugei Skill</p>\n<p><strong>Honor:</strong> 5.5</p>\n<p><strong>Outfit:</strong> Extravagant Clothing, Wakizashi, any 1 weapon, Calligraphy Set, Traveling Pack, Horse (Unicorn riding horse), 10 koku</p>\n<p><strong>Affinity/Deficiency:</strong> Water / Fire</p>\n<p><strong>Spells:</strong> Sense, Commune, Summon, 3 Water, 2 Earth, and 1 Air</p>\n\n<p>[CR p.67-87]</p>","specialRules":"<h4>TECHNIQUE: SPIRIT OF THE WIND</h4>\n<p>Complex Action: sacrifice spell slot to grant target additional Simple Move Action (must use next Turn). Free Raise on Travel keyword spells.</p>","freeRaises":0},"effects":[],"folder":"L5R4 Enhanced/Schools/Unicorn/Shugenja","sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
